In the first, the LOD scores are for a 7-degree-of-freedom comparison among the 8 founder haplotypes.

In the second, the LOD scores are for a 1-degree-of-freedom comparison between the two SNP alleles, having collapsed the founder haplotypes using their SNP genotypes.

karl

